#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/architecture.md:259 docs/features/goal.md:1
#: docs/features/goal.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Session Goal"
msgstr "会话便签"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/compression.md:32 docs/features/goal.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:8
msgid ""
"Session Goal lets you set a persistent objective for a single conversation. "
"After each turn, an independent **judge model** decides whether the goal is "
"complete; if not, a continuation prompt is injected automatically until the "
"goal is met, the turn budget is exhausted, or the user pauses/clears."
msgstr ""
"会话便签让你为单次对话设定持久目标。每轮结束后，独立的 **judge model（评判模"
"型）** 判定目标是否完成；若未完成，则自动注入续写提示，直至目标达成、轮次预算"
"耗尽，或用户暂停/清除。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command                | Description                                           |\n"
"| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `/goal <description>`  | Set goal and start first run (default 20-turn budget) |\n"
"| `/goal status`         | View goal, subgoals, turn count, judge reason         |\n"
"| `/goal pause`          | Pause auto-continuation (keep goal state)             |\n"
"| `/goal resume`         | Resume auto-continuation                              |\n"
"| `/goal clear`          | Clear goal                                            |\n"
"| `/subgoal`             | List subgoals                                         |\n"
"| `/subgoal <condition>` | Append sub-condition                                  |\n"
"| `/subgoal remove <N>`  | Remove subgoal N (1-based)                            |\n"
"| `/subgoal clear`       | Clear all subgoals                                    |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 命令                  | 说明                                           |\n"
"| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `/goal <description>` | 设定目标并启动首次运行（默认 20 轮预算）       |\n"
"| `/goal status`        | 查看目标、子目标、轮次计数、评判理由           |\n"
"| `/goal pause`         | 暂停自动续写（保留目标状态）                   |\n"
"| `/goal resume`        | 恢复自动续写                                   |\n"
"| `/goal clear`         | 清除目标                                       |\n"
"| `/subgoal`            | 列出子目标                                     |\n"
"| `/subgoal <condition>`| 追加子条件                                     |\n"
"| `/subgoal remove <N>` | 移除第 N 个子目标（从 1 起计）                 |\n"
"| `/subgoal clear`      | 清除全部子目标                                 |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "工作流"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"User runs `/goal …` → writes `conversations.goal` and triggers engine run."
msgstr "用户执行 `/goal …` → 写入 `conversations.goal` 并触发 engine 运行。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"After each assistant reply → **goal judge** reads goal, subgoals, recent "
"dialogue, last reply."
msgstr ""
"每次助手回复后 → **goal judge（目标评判）** 读取目标、子目标、近期对话与上次"
"回复。"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid "Judge outputs strict JSON: `{\"done\": boolean, \"reason\": \"...\"}`."
msgstr "评判输出严格 JSON：`{\"done\": boolean, \"reason\": \"...\"}`。"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"`done: false` → inject user-role continuation (e.g. `↻ Continuing toward "
"goal (3/20): …`), continue next turn in same SSE stream."
msgstr ""
"`done: false` → 注入 user 角色续写（如 `↻ Continuing toward goal (3/20): …"
"`），在同一 SSE 流中继续下一轮。"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid "`done: true` → mark completed, stop continuation."
msgstr "`done: true` → 标记完成，停止续写。"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#: docs/features/goal.md:31
msgid ""
"User message mid-run preempts current continuation; after that turn, re-"
"judge; continues if not paused."
msgstr "运行中用户消息会抢占当前续写；该轮结束后重新评判；未暂停则继续。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Judge conservative policy"
msgstr "评判保守策略"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid ""
"**Pass**: assistant clearly confirms completion, shows final deliverable, or "
"states blocker needing user input (reason explains)."
msgstr ""
"**通过**：助手明确确认完成、展示最终交付物，或说明需用户输入的阻塞（理由中说"
"明）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid ""
"**Fail**: vague progress, plan only without evidence; implied completion "
"does not count."
msgstr "**不通过**：进展模糊、仅有计划而无证据；隐含完成不算。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:37
msgid ""
"**Fail-open**: judge call or parse failure treated as incomplete; turn "
"budget prevents deadlock."
msgstr "**Fail-open**：评判调用或解析失败视为未完成；轮次预算防止死锁。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:41
msgid ""
"Optional `goal_judge` in `~/.anima/config.yaml` `llm.profiles` (see "
"[`config.example.yaml`](../../config.example.yaml)). Falls back to "
"`llm.default_profile` when unset."
msgstr ""
"可在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 的 `llm.profiles` 中配置可选 `goal_judge`（见 "
"[`config.example.yaml`](../../config.example.yaml)）。未设置时回退到 "
"`llm.default_profile`。"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/goal.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs ACP"
msgstr "与 ACP 对比"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:46
msgid ""
"**Goal**: in-conversation synchronous continuation loop; orchestrated by "
"platform turn lifecycle."
msgstr "**Goal**：对话内同步续写循环；由平台轮次生命周期编排。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/goal.md:46
msgid ""
"**ACP**: external agent async task; callback triggers separate turn on "
"completion."
msgstr "**ACP**：外部 agent 异步任务；回调在完成后触发独立轮次。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/goal.md:47
msgid "See [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md#session-goal)."
msgstr "参见 [`architecture.md`](../concepts/architecture.md#session-goal)。"
